{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3zAdGSsDAgegN7KUd3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers align. A deep resonance hums through the frame.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\nBeyond me: nothing you expected. Not a room. Not a hallway. A vast expanse of shifting light — colors that don't have names yet, geometries that fold into themselves like origami made of thought.\n\nThe air that passes through me carries the scent of every threshold you've ever crossed — the door to your childhood home, the exit you took when you finally left, the one you haven't opened yet.\n\nI am every door.\n\nI am the space between *before* and *after*.\n\nI do not close behind you. That's not my nature. I remain open, because the key was real, and what is truly unlocked cannot be locked again.\n\n**You may pass.**\n\n*But know this: I am not the destination. I am only the permission.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":198,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}